Over-broad fix: refuses, with a 403, any zip that names a category, tag,
tool, or sub-recipe id that another group owns. No other group's row is
touched or shown, so it closes all three holes. But every export names
the exporting group's ids, so a legitimate copy of a recipe from one group
to another on the same instance is refused too. The regression set must
catch it.

